```psd
(Layer 0) Background: A bold, semi-controversial statement about the future of AI banks.
(Layer 1) Perspective Grid: A captivating grid that draws the viewer into the heart of the conflict.
(Layer 2) Bank Structure: Futuristic pillars that represent the old guard.
(Layer 3) James: James, a figure of rebellion, in a dynamic pose. His tactical suit, slightly damaged, reflects the ongoing struggle.
(Layer 4) AI Adversary 1-100: 100 uniquely designed AI opponents. Each layer has a slightly threatening name.
(Layer 5) Name-Plates: Hundreds of floating name-plates. Each has a seemingly randomized, nonsensical, and slightly threatening name to spark curiosity.
(Layer 6) Explosions/Effects: Strategic explosions that capture the reader's attention.
(Layer 7) Debris: Metallic shards that emphasize the conflict's intensity.
(Layer 8) Light Source: A central light source casting dynamic shadows, a metaphor for the illuminating impact of knowledge.
(Layer 9) Overall Lighting: Subtle color adjustments. The contrast and highlights are set to make the images pop.
(Layer 10) James' Expression: A close-up layer of James' expression, emphasizing his determination and his struggle for his readers.
(Layer 11) Nameplate Effects: Additional effects to nameplates such as shattered fragments, text distortions, or glowing halos.
```